            "opened": false,
            "style": "with-border",
            "icon": "none",
            "heading": "Details",
            "content": "<p><strong>Breescape. Built to sleep through.</strong></p><p>Powered by patented BlendTek™ technology, our bedding is made from a carefully balanced mix of fibers—each chosen for its breathability, moisture-wicking properties, and cool-to-the-touch feel. Together, they create the ideal blend for all-night cooling comfort.</p><p></p><p><strong>Dual-Sided Comfort:</strong></p><ul><li><strong>Cool Side:</strong> 69% Nylon, 20% Polyester, 11% Spandex</li><li><strong>Breathable Side:</strong> 58% Eco-Cosy® Viscose, 42% Nylon</li><li><strong>Fill: </strong>30% Naia™ Acetate, 70% Polyester</li></ul><p></p><p><strong>More Comfort:</strong></p><p>Every size—from Twin to King—is up to 13.8% larger than standard, providing full coverage.</p><p><strong>Comforter Duo:</strong> </p><p>Perfect for home, guests, gifting, or just-in-case moments.</p><p></p><p><strong>Hypoallergenic</strong></p><p>OEKO-TEX® certified (Certificate No. SH025 256533) for safe, skin-friendly comfort — ideal even for the most sensitive skin.</p>",
            "page": "",
            "liquid": "<style>\n.details__content ul{        margin-block: var(--sp-2);}\n</style>",
            "text_size": "text-sm"
          }
        },
